[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2189225371","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2500#issuecomment-2189225371","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2500","id":2189225371,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86CfO2b","user":{"login":"xsuchy","id":85769,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NzY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85769?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy","html_url":"https://github.com/xsuchy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xsuchy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-06-25T15:12:16Z","updated_at":"2024-06-25T15:12:16Z","body":"Text of the exception:\r\n\r\n```\r\nAdditional permission under GPLv3 section 7:\r\n\r\nIf you modify this Program, or any covered work, by linking or\r\ncombining it with OpenSSL, or a modified version of OpenSSL licensed\r\nunder the OpenSSL license\r\n(https://www.openssl.org/source/license.html), the licensors of this\r\nProgram grant you additional permission to convey the resulting\r\nwork. Corresponding Source for a non-source form of such a\r\ncombination shall include the source code for the parts that are\r\nlicensed under the OpenSSL license as well as that of the covered\r\nwork.\r\n```","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2189225371/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2189543662","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2500#issuecomment-2189543662","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2500","id":2189543662,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86Cgcju","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-06-25T17:29:17Z","updated_at":"2024-06-25T17:29:17Z","body":"Agreed that it's close but not quite a match to [`GPL-3.0-linking-source-exception`](https://spdx.org/licenses/GPL-3.0-linking-source-exception.html). The differences are (in my view) largely non-substantive, mostly relating to references to OpenSSL and its license terms specifically, but done in a way that causes it not to match with the templating in the existing exception.\r\n\r\nI suspect it would be a pain to implement markup in a straightforward way to handle it, so I'm +1 to add it as a separate entry / identifier.\r\n\r\nFor the name and identifier, I note that there's already a [`389-exception`](https://spdx.org/licenses/389-exception.html) on the list. It isn't the same, but @xsuchy is the \"389 Directory Server\" referenced there the same as the 389-ds-base package you're raising here? If so, then a similar / adjacent name and identifier might be appropriate.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2189543662/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2218679583","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2500#issuecomment-2218679583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2500","id":2218679583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86EPl0f","user":{"login":"karsten-klein","id":20038021,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDM4MDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20038021?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein","html_url":"https://github.com/karsten-klein","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karsten-klein/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-09T20:33:14Z","updated_at":"2024-07-09T20:33:14Z","body":"**{metæffekt} Universe**\r\ncanonical name: [OpenSSL Linking Exception (GPL; with source provisioning obligation)](https://github.com/org-metaeffekt/metaeffekt-universe/blob/main/src/main/resources/ae-universe/[o]/README.md#user-content-OpenSSL-Linking-Exception-(GPL;with-source-provisioning-obligation):~:text=OpenSSL%20Linking%20Exception%20(GPL;%20with%20source%20provisioning%20obligation))\r\nshort name: OpenSSL-Linking-Exception-GPL-source\r\nmarkers: Extended Source Obligation Marker\r\ncategory: OpenSSL Linking Exception\r\nOSI status: _none_\r\n\r\n**ScanCode**\r\nmatched id: [gpl-3.0](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/gpl-3.0.LICENSE)\r\nmatched id: [gpl-3.0-linking-source-exception](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/gpl-3.0-linking-source-exception.LICENSE)\r\nmatched id: [openssl-ssleay](https://github.com/nexB/scancode-toolkit/blob/develop/src/licensedcode/data/licenses/openssl-ssleay.LICENSE)\r\n\r\n**Comment**\r\nThe exception seems to match the ScanCode exception gpl-3.0-linking-source-exception, which represents a template with many variable parts.\r\n\r\nI'd specifically like to understand the legal perspective on \r\n> \"Corresponding Source for a non-source form of such a combination shall include the source code for the parts that are\r\nlicensed under the OpenSSL license as well as that of the covered work.\"\r\n\r\nApart of the exception regarding the freedom of license choice of other parts, the corresponding source code of the covered needs to be conveyed. Thus this is an exception with an additional obligation. An obligation that may not be resolvable in a commercial context.\r\n\r\nDue to the inclined risk of having this exception I vote +1 for adding this license or a template that covers the license.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2218679583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2250992732","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2500#issuecomment-2250992732","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2500","id":2250992732,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86GK2xc","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-25T17:03:21Z","updated_at":"2024-08-08T16:21:01Z","body":"If OpenSSL was under GPL, you'd have to provide CCS. But OpenSSL License is considered incompatible with GPL according to the FSF - This is likely why there are various exceptions related to OpenSSL. \r\n\r\nIn this case, the exception is to \"fix\" the issue of incompatibility of the licenses, but clarify that the requirement to provide the CCS still applies.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.co